// Project 4: Microsoft Sentinel SIEM Investigation & Detection
// Query 02: Suspicious Source IP Investigation
//
// Purpose:
// Determine whether the suspicious source IP associated with the
// M. Lopez alert appears in authentication activity for other users.
//
// Investigative Question:
// Is 45.83.64.19 associated with normal Northstar authentication
// activity, or is it isolated to the affected account?
//
// Training Note:
// This project uses synthetic telemetry in a Microsoft Sentinel-style
// environment for cybersecurity portfolio and training purposes.

SigninLogs
| where IPAddress == "45.83.64.19"
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    UserPrincipalName,
    IPAddress,
    Location,
    AppDisplayName,
    ResultType
| order by TimeGenerated desc
